 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                              MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, BS1 5TR Bristol, United Kingdom    AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB583537457\nReg No: GB-451538\n\nFROM\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                                     BILL TO\n221 Baker Street                                                             Granite & Co Ltd\nBS1 5TR Bristol                                                              Unit 7, Riverside Estate\nUnited Kingdom                                                               M1 2AB Manchester\nVAT: GB583537457                                                             United Kingdom\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 19/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Bristol (\"Party A\"), and Granite & Co Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7,\nRiverside Estate, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nParty B      Granite & Co Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nDate         19/02/2026",
